# The dev image is built from dev/ and rust/Cargo.* alone (dev/Dockerfile);
# the checkout is mounted at run time instead.  Allow-list, so nothing else --
# rust/target, a stray socket, .claude/ -- is ever sent to the builder.
# dev/perf/ is the A/B harness, which runs from the checkout's copy in /work:
# the image does not use it (and dev/run.sh leaves it out of the checksum).
*
!dev/
dev/perf/
!rust/Cargo.toml
!rust/Cargo.lock
